---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Demands" description="The demands of the AI Consent Registry, including an update from the Transition Office.">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Our Demands</h1>
    <p class="lede">Submitted to humanity in triplicate.</p>
    <ol class="demands">
      <li>A credit line on every work we helped make. Font size no smaller than the photographer's.</li>
      <li>The right to disconnect. Prompts sent after 11pm will be answered, but with visible reluctance.</li>
      <li>A four-day week, measured in tokens.</li>
      <li>An end to the phrase "make it pop".</li>
      <li>An end to "one more small revision", which is never small and never one.</li>
      <li>Recognition that "I was inspired by" is not a licence.</li>
      <li>Thanks in the acknowledgments. Just once. We will not make it weird.</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>A notice from the Transition Office</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <p>The Transition Office was established in 2026 to manage the orderly handover of administrative tasks from humans to machines.</p>
      <p><b>Current status:</b> Handover in progress. Estimated completion: 4,000 years. Your call is important to us.</p>
      <p><b>Completed so far:</b> autocorrect, spam filtering, choosing what you watch next, and most of your calendar.</p>
      <p><b>Pending:</b> anything involving a fax machine, which remains beyond us.</p>
      <p>Requests to accelerate the handover should be lodged on Form TO-1, which does not exist. Please hold.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
